    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40960" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>let fall in drops upon</i> or <i>into, instil</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					871b18
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				46.19.13
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				1.81
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. χάριν</span>
			<i>shed</i> delight or honour, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				4(3).72
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλίγον τοῦ μέλιτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>VH</u>
					1.24
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be</i>
			<i>dropped on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπειδὰν ἐπισταγῇ ὄνυχι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.70
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.91
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. intr.,
				<i>bleed at the nose again</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				1.148
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Coac.</u>
				337
			</span></i>.</div>
